{"id":"fd713aec6d1a8dd1","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-sheafification-adjunction.md","title":"Theorem — Sheafification Adjunction","display":"Theorem — Sheafification Adjunction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-sheafification-adjunction","aliases":["14-thm-sheafification-adjunction"],"display":"Theorem — Sheafification Adjunction","depends_on":["[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]","[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-sheafification-adjunction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-sheafification-adjunction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Sheafification Adjunction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4123133f8910827a\" href=\"?note=4123133f8910827a\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit\">14-df-sheafification-functor-unit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 为小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 为层范畴包含函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\(a:\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:1\\to ia\">\\(\\eta:1\\to ia\\)</span> 是候选数据。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4123133f8910827a\" href=\"?note=4123133f8910827a\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit\">14-df-sheafification-functor-unit</a>；伴随见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(a,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(a,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.5 Theorem 1 及其证明末段，印刷页 128、133；DjVu 第 70、72 图页。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\">\\(F,G\\)</span>，泛箭头给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}(aF,G)\\cong\\mathrm{Hom}(F,iG)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}(aF,G)\\cong\\mathrm{Hom}(F,iG)\\)</span>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4123133f8910827a\" href=\"?note=4123133f8910827a\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit\">14-df-sheafification-functor-unit</a> 的箭头方程保证该双射对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 自然，故是伴随。旧式只有对象逐个存在泛箭头，不能约束预先给定函子的箭头作用，现已补足。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit","status":"resolved","id":"4123133f8910827a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit","status":"resolved","id":"4123133f8910827a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$i$ 为层范畴包含函子。$a:\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)$、$\\eta:1\\to ia$ 是候选数据。$\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)$ 见 [[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]；伴随见 [[14-df-adjoint-functors]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$i$ 为层范畴包含函子。$a:\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)$、$\\eta:1\\to ia$ 是候选数据。$\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)$ 见 [[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]；伴随见 [[14-df-adjoint-functors]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit","status":"resolved","id":"4123133f8910827a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书定位：III.5 Theorem 1 及其证明末段，印刷页 128、133；DjVu 第 70、72 图页。对每个 $F,G$，泛箭头给 $\\mathrm{Hom}(aF,G)\\cong\\mathrm{Hom}(F,iG)$；[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]] 的箭头方程保证该双射对 $F$ 自然，故是伴随。旧式只有对象逐个存在泛箭头，不能约束预先给定函子的箭头作用，现已补足。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\widehat{\\mathcal C}\\to\\mathbf{Sh}(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta:1\\to ia","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\mathrm{IsAdjunction}(a,i).","display":true},{"tex":"F,G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hom}(aF,G)\\cong\\mathrm{Hom}(F,iG)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false}],"bytes":1262,"backlinks":[{"id":"